### Camera-alone validation against Sun et al., arXiv:2608.21216, Sec. 4.1:
### camera pointing at the sky, CH1*CH2 coincidence (thresholds 427.6 keV),
### CH0 threshold 330 keV. Paper: ~10 triggers/min, ~4000 three-layer muons in
### ~15 h, MIP MPV 4.86 / 1.63 / 1.56 MeV for CH0 / CH1 / CH2 (angle-corrected).
### 2.7e6 muons on the 60 x 60 cm plane correspond to ~15 h. Analysis:
###   root -l -b -q 'analysis/camera_validation.C("output/camera_validation.root")'

/control/execute macro/geom_camera_only.mac

/OutputFormat 1
/EventFilter 1
/OutputDirectory output
/OutputFile camera_validation
/gun/seed 2026

/GeneralParticleSource 2
/tof/cosmic/planeCenter 0 0 2 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfX 30 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfY 30 cm
/tof/cosmic/thetaMax 85 deg
/tof/cosmic/energyMin 0 GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMax 1000 GeV
/tof/cosmic/charge both

/run/beamOn 2700000
